pynextcloud-sync (0.1.14) stable; urgency=medium

  * Add a protected first synchronization with an isolated fresh server
    snapshot, explicit merge review, and preserved conflict copies.
  * Require existing 0.1.13 installations to create a reviewed safety baseline
    before automatic synchronization resumes.
  * Block missing, replaced, empty, unreadable, or abnormally reduced local
    trees before nextcloudcmd starts; add recovery and one-time approval flows.
  * Archive stale synchronization databases instead of silently reusing or
    deleting them.

